# modbusspec-sweep 0: every register of a real device read alone, and its replies, in runs
device: meter/fronius/smart-meter-ts
product: Fronius Smart Meter TS 65A-3 (production year 2022)
unit: 1
link: RS485 9600 8N1, FTDI USB cable, no other master on the line
date: 2026-11-02, 01:09 to 02:56; paused about 01:11 to 01:12 for the 43/14 requests
requests: one register each, function 03 for 0-65535, then 04 for 0-65535, 10 ms apart; timeout 150 ms, no retries
state: only L1 live (L1 voltage 235.8 V, L2 and L3 0), no load
masked: holding and input 0x5000-0x5008, the serial number; Md a digit, Mu an upper-case letter, Ml a lower-case one, Mx anything else
format: 'function address[-last] reply: four hex digits, Ex exception code x, S no reply, B bad frame. A run gives each register of it,
  read alone, the same reply. 43/14 lines: Read Device Identification, code object[-last] reply.'
